From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Swanson <rswanson05@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:12:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat: box each space in the sidebar

Spaces in the spaces list (and each machine's spaces in the multi-machine list) sit in boxes; neighbouring spaces share a border row, and worktree children stay inside their parent's box. Sidebars narrower than 12 columns go without boxes.

